.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is the macOS installer and lifecycle CLI for
.Lk https://github.com/Crosstalk-Solutions/project-nomad "Project NOMAD" ,
an offline AI + knowledge server.
The CLI sits above the admin-layer patches contributed by the macOS community
fork lineage (snfettig, NoamanKhalil, proximasan), providing a single-file
bash entry point for installation, lifecycle management, model pulls,
benchmarking, and recovery operations.
.Pp
On Apple Silicon, the installer runs Ollama natively (Metal-accelerated) while
the admin/MySQL/Redis stack runs in OrbStack containers. Storage is split
between always-internal hot state (mysql, redis under
.Pa ~/.config/project-nomad/state )
and a configurable cold content root
.Pa ${NOMAD_DATA_ROOT}
that may be on an external drive and safely unplugged.
